<title>USA: Just For Feet sets 3-for2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Just For Feet sets 3-for2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BIRMINGHAM, Ala. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Just For Feet Inc said Tuesday its board of directors approved a three-for-two stock split in the form of a 50-percent common stock dividend.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed October 15 to shareholders of record on September 27.</p>
</text>
